      "Our street has offered to host a workshop where residents and engineers can read the flood maps together. Several neighbours are anxious about technical terms, and I ask that the material be available in plain language as well as in its full scientific form. Neither version should hide the uncertainty. Understanding a risk is not the same as accepting it; it is the condition for making an informed choice about it."
